"Have you got a reservation? (Did you book?)": "Have you got a reservation? (Você tem reserva?)",
"The menu shows the food and prices.": "The menu (cardápio) mostra os pratos e os preços.",
"Are you ready to order?": "Are you ready to order? (Já podem pedir?)",
