"Each set has 10 sentences. Choose the correct word, then press Check answers.": "Cada série tem 10 frases. Escolha a palavra correta e depois aperte Check answers.",
"Choose the correct word.": "Escolha a palavra correta.",
"tell + person: tell me, tell her. Say doesn't take a person directly.": "tell + pessoa: tell me, tell her. Say não leva a pessoa diretamente.",
"say (that)… with no person. (She told me that she was tired.)": "say (that)… sem pessoa depois. (She told me that she was tired.)",
"tell someone a story / a joke / the truth.": "tell someone a story / a joke / the truth (contar uma história / uma piada / a verdade).",
"look at = turn your eyes towards something on purpose.": "look at = olhar para algo de propósito.",
"watch TV / a film / a match = look at something that moves, for some time.": "watch TV / a film / a match = assistir, olhar algo que se move por um tempo.",
"see = notice with your eyes (you don't need to try). We often say can/can't see.": "see = ver, perceber com os olhos (sem esforço). Muitas vezes dizemos can/can't see.",
"hear = sounds come to your ears. Can you hear…?": "hear = ouvir, os sons chegam aos seus ouvidos. Can you hear…?",
"listen to = try to hear, on purpose.": "listen to = escutar, tentar ouvir de propósito.",
"speak a language (not 'talk Spanish').": "speak a language (falar uma língua; e não 'talk Spanish').",
"What did he say? (no person after the verb).": "What did he say? (sem pessoa depois do verbo).",
"borrow = take something that you will give back.": "borrow = pegar algo emprestado que você vai devolver.",
"lend = give something that the person will give back. Lend someone something.": "lend = emprestar algo que a pessoa vai devolver. Lend someone something.",
"take = carry something away from here to another place.": "take = levar algo daqui para outro lugar.",
