"Choose the correct adjective.": "Escolha o adjetivo correto.",
"We say heavy rain.": "Dizemos heavy rain (chuva forte).",
"We say strong coffee (with a lot of coffee in it).": "Dizemos strong coffee (café forte, com bastante café).",
